   "message": "1 section(s) have content at both edges and 1721px of nothing between: \"Benzer ürünler\"",
   "fix": "Bring the two parts together on the grid, or put the picture or figure of the section in the middle. An empty middle third reads as a hole, the same as an empty half.",
